<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Dear&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName},</span></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Thank you for your interest in the Online Sociology Master’s Program at the T. Denny Sanford School of Social and Family Dynamics! Please review the <a href="https://thesanfordschool.asu.edu/sites/default/files/handbook_soc_online_ma_2015_12_30.pdf">program handbook</a> for information on program procedures, policy, courses offered, timelines and more.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">This program has a rolling admissions policy and students are admitted as applications are received. Please visit the <a href="https://thesanfordschool.asu.edu/node/19">program’s website</a> for more information regarding the program.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/dgsadmissions/Index.jsp">Submit your application today</a>.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Please <a href="mailto:graduatesanford@asu.edu">email me</a> any questions about the application or program.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Thank you and we look forward to hearing from you!</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><b>Gina Perez, M.Ed.</b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Graduate Programs Coordinator</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">T. Denny Sanford School of Social and Family Dynamics</font></div><div><font face="arial" color="#ffffff">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>